        "created_at": "2017-10-07T12:47:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>At this point we don't have a set date on when the KS for the core book will launch (outside most likely Q1 2018) nor how long after the KS it will be until the book is delivered. &nbsp; It just depends how quickly you want to get started into this and see examples of how characters are built from core heroes we know. &nbsp;</p>",
